    "note": "Vaccinations follow the UK routine schedule as changed in July 2025 and January 2026, picked by date of birth. Health visitor contacts follow England's Healthy Child Programme; Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland run their own programmes with different review ages, so check with your health visitor. The flu vaccine is offered each autumn rather than on a birthday. To be checked against the current NHS schedule before release.",
