          "months": 0,
          "weeks": 0,
          "days": 0
        },
        "window_end": {
          "months": 0,
          "weeks": 0,
          "days": 3
        },
        "description": "A check of the eyes, heart, hips and, for boys, testicles, within 72 hours of birth (usually before you leave hospital). It's repeated at 6 to 8 weeks.",
